      "id": "natures-tomb",
      "name": "Nature's Tomb",
      "description": "Three organisms under dark-field light. KNOB 6 picks the organism: centre the egg cell, right the slime mold, left the mycelium. KNOB 5 sets the development level \u2014 cell divisions, the colony's reach, the hyphal growth \u2014 and any pad steps it; sway morphs each organism, press squeezes, the hand pans and dollies. The rack stays off.",
